Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,...but I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,So Okumura-senpai is going to take\Nthe pictures for my first cosrom!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:10.54,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,432)}{\an7}Milky\N{\pos(870.4,482.4)}{\an7}Succubus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:12.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, cosplay pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that skimpy outfit?\NAnd she wants to sell them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And what the heck is a ‘Milky Succubus’?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is beyond weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.25,0:00:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You’re not, like, embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:26.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I’m a little bit embarrassed, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought you weren’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:31.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, that won’t stop me and my desire to\Nshow everyone how much I love Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that what this is about?\NShowing you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should’ve guessed he would be this easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,57.6)}{\an7}TOTALLY GETS IT NOW
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank God he’s a weirdo otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tachibana-san, you knew I was cosplaying Liliel, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:01:00.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you like Liliel?\NDo you want to cosplay together?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, she’s a famous supermodel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There’s no way she’ll say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:04.96,Q3,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,There’s no way she’ll say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.96,0:01:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,See? I told y-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:07.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,WHAT?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:47.00,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,403.2)}{\an7}Lili x Miri
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.63,0:02:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn’t I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:55.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ll do anything if there’s a chance\Nit’ll make Senpai fall for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta keep my eye on this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have a crush on anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.29,0:03:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,There was a way longer pause\Nbefore he answered this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I bet that virgin might\Nlook at her Liliel cosplay
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,and think he’s falling for her instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, there’s only one thing for me to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Put on a costume and get him to fall for me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think you should try cosplaying Miriella.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You mean her demon friend?\NWhy can’t I be Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.79,Q5,,0,0,0,,So you can take pictures with my Liliel cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You still read the manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.96,0:03:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna cosplay Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? But you’d make such a good Miriella.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:54.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai likes Liliel, right?\NSo I wanna cosplay Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why does him liking Liliel\Nmake you want to cosplay her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I like him,\Nand I want to cosplay the character he likes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not like I can tell her that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:06.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,B...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.92,0:04:10.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I like Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.42,0:04:12.63,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,57.6)}{\an7}ME TOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.75,0:04:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, you can have her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ll need to adjust the costume,\Nso go ahead and try it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually, I’ll do Miriella.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.38,0:04:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:30.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senpai! Do you like Miriella?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:35.08,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,252)}{\an7}I LOVE MIRIELLA
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:32.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love her love rivalry with Liliel,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the cute and sexy flirting\Nshe does with Ashford!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She knows he’ll never feel the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.33,0:04:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but still she carries a flame\Nfor him in her pure heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She’s got a cute figure and a great ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,and real otaku love a flat-chested lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:42.67,Q3,,0,0,0,,You said you’d never cheat on Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:42.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,and real otaku love a flat-chested lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:44.63,Q3,,0,0,0,,You said you’d never cheat on Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tig bitties would ruin her whole vibe, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Liliel’s my waifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:47.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miriella’s my imouto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.83,0:04:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don’t wanna be your goddamn sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, he at least thinks she’s sexy and cute,\Nso maybe I still have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, Tachibana-san, can I measure you?\NI’ll buy the materials after school!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you’re gonna make it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup! I make all my costumes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:03.25,Q8,,0,0,0,,I’ll need 30 cm of twill fabric,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:03.92,Q5,,0,0,0,,I’ll need 30 cm of twill fabric,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold up, how long is this gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.92,Q5,,0,0,0,,70 cm of stretch leather,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold up, how long is this gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:07.63,Q5,,0,0,0,,some duct tape and stretch thread...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.63,0:05:08.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me think...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t need much fabric, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can finish it tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:20.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.33,0:05:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, good timing, Tachibana-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.17,0:05:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I take your bust measurement again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:37.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who’s this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.67,0:05:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is Ririsa, she was Liliel yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.08,0:05:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She stayed up all night sewing and\Nbrought her gear to school to finish it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I slept through class and\Ncovered my bags with makeup,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,so we’re all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:51.63,Q3,,0,0,0,,So she’s the girl who slept through every period today...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’m torn on if I want to put extra stitching on the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,since the manga design is a\Nlittle different from the anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:56.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is anyone even gonna care?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course they will!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,A single stitch can change\Nthe whole look of a garment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The manga always shows\Nthe nipple through the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:04.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I’d want to put a stitch there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they leave that out from the anime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the anime is in color,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,so following the anime\Ndesign might look more authentic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:15.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fans of the manga might really\Ncare about that part of her design.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to make a cosplay that portrays\Nthe character design from every angle,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:23.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,so you look just like the character herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have to bring the two-dimensional\Ninto three dimensions...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Striving for that perfection is a real challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, that won’t stop me and my desire\Nto show everyone how much I love Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s kind of impressive.\NGuess cosplay is tougher than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,All finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold the hell up, you want me to wear this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s Miriella’s squad uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.25,0:06:52.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup, that’s her sexiest outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.63,0:06:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s worse than being naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:06:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can’t even do bikinis, let alone that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:07:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I’ll go get changed into mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.75,0:07:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That one’s not any better!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You’re really gonna wear that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She’s gonna be skimpy Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:09.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’ll kill Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.13,0:07:12.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't lose to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ve gotta win him over before she does!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, nice underwear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn’t wear it for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:24.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where’d you get it? It looks fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:25.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It’s not fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:34.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just so you know,\NI’m NOT jealous of these big fat blobs, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:35.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know how girls do that\Nwith each other in manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It’s kinda hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:40.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with your brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you not have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Also, could you stop calling me Tachibana-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just call me Mikari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It makes us sound like friends! Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you don’t need me, then stop saying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:07:59.29,Q3,,0,0,0,,Ririsa doesn’t have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:07:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you don’t need me, then stop saying it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:00.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,Ririsa doesn’t have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let’s do our makeup and get changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, let’s cover up your moles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anything else we need to cover up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, I can handle that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan, you’ve got one on your inner thigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We’re not gonna take any close-ups down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.67,0:08:20.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think we should make that our first close-up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:22.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! You’re not serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.04,Q3,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,EEP!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Warn me before you touch me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.33,0:08:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was a cute ‘eep’.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop teasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I’m done? Do I look okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You look perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don’t even recognize myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really hope this gets Senpai\Nto see me in a new light...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.83,0:08:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know he’ll never fall for me the way I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to change!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can look now, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just... had to do the old cliché.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:32.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You look incredible, Mikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Miriella is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai is looking at me and gushing!\NIt’s a new milestone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Ri... Liliel, you’re looking perfect as always!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But his eyes went straight for Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.63,0:09:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, duh, he likes Liliel,\Nbut Miriella’s not bad, right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know, I never liked his dumb manga,\Nbut I always kinda liked Miriella.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She falls for Ashford after he rescues her,\Nand always tries to flirt with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,but his heart’s already set on Liliel,\Nso she’ll never have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why won’t you look at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,She eventually becomes\Nfriends with Liliel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,but she never tells anyone how she feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She was so much like me.\NI could never hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why won’t you look at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s so Miriella!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:37.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your delivery was perfect! I’m floored!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s such an iconic line.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:42.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? I mean, I wasn’t trying to act it out or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,As long as I can get him to look at me like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-so, senpai, you said you liked her ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:11:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what do you think... of me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.75,0:11:04.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.29,0:11:08.17,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,468)}{\an7}(Love Miriella, that is.)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ten years of waiting,\Nand he finally says he loves me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:18.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ten long years I’ve waited to hear those words...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:18.67,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,108)}{\an7}(She’s ignoring the context.)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,For real, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This was all it took?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I waited ten years for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.63,0:11:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I’m still glad I tried this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Miriella! And Ririsa, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s take some pictures for our cosrom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:38.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We’re seriously gonna take pictures in these?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:39.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure my modeling contract says I can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:45.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won’t bother mentioning it.\NI’m after Senpai’s attention, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.63,0:11:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want me to pose like THAT?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.00,0:12:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We’re all ready to shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you get too embarrassed,\NMikari-chan, you can stop at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai and I can do the shoot without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.63,0:12:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And let them do it by themselves?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.25,0:12:15.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I won’t need to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’d rather be embarrassed than let\NSenpai fall in love with Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seriously, just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!\NI’m in double trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.79,0:12:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can’t let myself feel anything from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.58,0:12:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,This time, I’ll use my secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ll pretend to be the very man whose pure\Nintentions are never sullied by their seduction!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I myself will become Lord Ashford!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,At the ready, Liliel, Miriella!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:52.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now he’s getting into character, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let’s start with this pose, first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:13:01.79,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,165.6)}{\an7}LET ME HEAL YOU!\N{\pos(780.8,360)}{\an7}AHN!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The hottest scene between the two of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s right, the healing scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why does she need to touch her tits to heal her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:04.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, Liliel explains it in the manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.13,0:13:05.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Breasts are life-givers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy tissue that bequeaths life energy to newborns!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.21,0:13:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, you have to touch them for any life energy magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because that makes perfect sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, then... I’m gonna touch you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,J-just be gentle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.71,0:13:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Okumura!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Ashford has never gotten\Na boner for either of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.83,0:13:25.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this turning him on? Senpai’s into this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:28.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had my doubts... But this might work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe she’s being TOO gentle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,T-that was so good, Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to the manga,\Nmana infusion is supposed to feel orgasmic!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.75,0:13:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this porn?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got the perfect picture of your expression, Miriella!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.21,0:13:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I wasn’t roleplaying...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai saw that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And he took a picture of it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you give me a mana infusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.83,0:14:06.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miriella thanks Liliel for the healing\Nby replenishing some of her mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.46,0:14:07.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are you saying that with a straight face?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:10.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-so I just have to do what you did, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh my God, don’t moan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She didn’t mean it, Miriella!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mana infusions are orgasmic!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:21.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, she was just pretending?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:24.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this the power of a true mana infusion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.92,0:14:38.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Ashford bore witness to this and stayed flaccid?\NWhat a legend...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-he’s getting way more turned on by Liliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, do the infusion on me one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?! You want to redo those photos?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don’t pull so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What’s happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.21,0:14:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-our costumes are caught on each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.29,0:14:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, is it happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It is! God dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-my chestpiece is caught on hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.79,0:15:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she for real?!\NShe’s gonna make him help?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! If he helps Liliel, if he touches her...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, if he doesn’t...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:22.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,J-just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just do it already, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:28.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don’t want Ririsa’s costumes to tear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.38,0:15:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this seriously happening to me again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Focus! No thoughts, head empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:42.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Ashford would leap into action to save them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember, they’re just heavy bags of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,God damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,They don’t feel like sand at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:56.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It’s no use, Ririsa! I’ll break it if I pull on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:16:00.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then can you unhook the straps under my armpit?\NThat’ll make it come apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, hold on, don’t unhook it, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:03.58,Q3,,0,0,0,,Unhook the straps?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, hold on, don’t unhook it, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:04.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-wait, hold on, don’t unhook it, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There was a downside to that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:18.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y’know, Lord Ashford doesn’t survive all his battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:23.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.33,0:16:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,M-Mikari-chan! Hold on a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.79,0:16:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,So when Miriella says this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:36.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,she’s deciding to hide her feelings for\NAshford to protect her friendship with Liliel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that’s what I’m saying!\NI thought it was obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it totally is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You totally understand where\NMiriella’s coming from, Mikari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry I never figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.21,0:16:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari, I should’ve known...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.46,0:16:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,...you’re still a huge otaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:56.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? No, I’ve never been a weirdo otaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.75,0:16:59.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought you’d forgotten all about the manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.33,0:17:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, it’s been really fun talking about it with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:06.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so desperate to get him to like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never actually tried to get the things he liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.67,0:17:22.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai wasn’t happy to see me dressed as Miriella.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was happy because he thought\Nwe both loved his favorite manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay brought me into the\Nworld he loves so dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-well, thank you for taking\Npictures with me, Mikari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.83,0:17:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Our cosrom is gonna be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.33,0:17:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you can’t use my pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.79,0:17:53.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’d be breaking my modeling contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So these all have to be shelved?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:18:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry. The pro model stuff is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You just have to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see why you like cosplay now, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’d be cool doing it with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:10.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I had so much fun\Ndoing a group cosplay with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.13,0:18:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.25,0:18:21.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don’t need to rush. After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.79,0:18:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai’s 3D, too. This might not be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry ‘bout it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.54,0:18:36.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What was I feeling just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.38,0:18:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I sure had fun today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:42.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Too bad we can’t use the photos, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:45.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai! Speaking of photos...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.71,0:18:51.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,We actually have enough pictures\Nto put out a cosrom now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let’s put one together and sell it at a cosplay event!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It’s finally happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:19:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ve already applied for a table\Nat an event next month, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.83,0:19:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It’s during Golden Week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.71,0:19:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So we’ve got a little over a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’m really hoping we can make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:08.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We’ve got a whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Editing takes a ton of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.17,0:19:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have to touch up the pictures,\Nthen code the HTML...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can learn how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:20.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? No, I’ll do it all myself! You don’t have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.88,0:19:21.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I said I would help, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but this is a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.46,0:19:28.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And way more boring than taking pictures.\NYou’d hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.21,0:19:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, I didn’t say I’d only help out with the easy bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:37.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,We’re doing this together, right?\NThat’s what I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:43.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I know, but... I don’t know how\NI could ever make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.13,0:19:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You don’t have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’ve been having tons of fun doing this with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay! Then I’d love your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we keep quiet during\Nthe rounds at 10 and 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,we can get away with working here overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.92,0:20:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got scared for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:12.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s get started!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, let’s pick out the photos we want to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.63,0:20:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once we find the best shot of each of the\Nposes that works with the cosrom theme,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,we drag it into the app and adjust the color,\Nedit out any blemishes, just make it perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,And we’ll have to do that for about 500 photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Five hundred?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, let’s get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is taking a lot longer than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.96,0:20:42.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,If each one takes five minutes, then 500 is gonna take...\NA while, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don’t give up.\NIt’s only 41 hours and 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.75,0:20:53.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we’re gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.13,0:20:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,We’ve got this, Ririsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.63,0:20:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should’ve started way earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or applied for the next event instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don’t start saying that...\Nor you won’t be able to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.17,0:21:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.04,0:21:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don’t back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Together, we’ll make it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.96,0:21:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is someone in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.75,0:21:19.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is someone in here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.04,0:21:21.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If he gets in, I’ll pop out and apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.67,0:21:22.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You stay hidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.33,0:21:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Ririsa. I’ve got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, but... Senpai, you’re really close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:34.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He’s gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, back to work, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:10.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, Ririsa. I’ve got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.88,0:22:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That’s right. He’s got me covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:20.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I’m not alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We’re going to make the best cosrom ever, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.04,0:24:00.96,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,388.8)}{\an7}Time For Our First Event!
